WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:29.730
KNOW

01:42.120 --> 01:46.590
Ok, I'm not moving,
but what are we going to do?

01:49.240 --> 01:50.590
It will be all right.

01:50.760 --> 01:56.800
My sister's power is for attacking and mine is for defending.

02:05.600 --> 02:07.480
Kaguya, Yume.

02:08.200 --> 02:09.430
Urashima!

02:09.880 --> 02:12.840
How you have grown, Kaguya, Yume.

02:13.800 --> 02:17.630
THE MOON FLOATS

02:17.800 --> 02:21.560
IN THE DARK SKY

02:21.720 --> 02:26.400
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

02:29.720 --> 02:33.600
I HEAR THE SONG

02:33.760 --> 02:37.440
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

02:37.760 --> 02:41.640
LET US RETURN, LET US RETURN

02:41.800 --> 02:44.440
THERE WHERE THEY SING

02:46.720 --> 02:53.910
FULL MOON OF AUTUMN

02:54.760 --> 02:57.560
DISTANT LIGHT

02:57.720 --> 03:02.270
OF THE NATIVE LAND

03:02.640 --> 03:06.680
THAT CANNOT ILLUMINATE

03:05.760 --> 03:10.470
Kaguya has the power to invoke the
fire of the Earth to kill the ayakashi.

03:06.680 --> 03:09.680
SUCH LASTING DARKNESS

03:10.640 --> 03:16.320
Yume has the power to invoke Heaven to
make snow fall and calm Earth down.

03:10.850 --> 03:14.940
THOUGH YOU ARE SO FAR AWAY...

03:16.520 --> 03:20.200
Heaven, Earth: my Yin and Yang technique...

03:20.360 --> 03:27.560
Musashi's reassuring vitality, they are
all the conditions to realize my wish.

03:27.920 --> 03:30.310
All that is missing are the artifacts.

03:36.800 --> 03:39.760
What, the ayakashi are still alive?

03:39.920 --> 03:41.190
It is the soul of Gaki!

03:41.720 --> 03:43.040
Gaki's soul?

03:43.440 --> 03:47.670
The soul that devours everything without
distinction? What is it doing here?

03:48.160 --> 03:54.990
The monster without heart or materiality that devours everything without any mercy!

03:56.000 --> 04:00.440
It never dies and finds no peace while imprisoned.

04:00.960 --> 04:02.470
Urashima, what are we gonna do?

04:03.320 --> 04:04.960
Urashima, what should we do?

04:05.160 --> 04:07.990
In other times, a certain Takuan imprisoned him.

04:08.160 --> 04:12.710
But I will kill this monster who never dies.

04:18.560 --> 04:20.760
Unbelievable, he swallowed everything!

04:20.920 --> 04:22.830
Makes you wonder who is hungrier!

04:26.320 --> 04:28.630
Danjo, Desperado!

04:28.800 --> 04:31.240
Rokuemon Ishikawa, Ronin!

04:31.400 --> 04:33.310
They got eaten...

04:39.880 --> 04:43.400
Here, I got the sixth artifact!

04:43.560 --> 04:46.070
Only one more to go!

04:49.490 --> 04:54.400
DESTRUCTION

05:04.640 --> 05:06.360
It's Mount Aso.

05:06.520 --> 05:07.720
Rest assured.

05:07.840 --> 05:12.470
We were on the island of Sado
and now suddenly at Mount Aso!

05:12.880 --> 05:16.110
The teleport is really practical!

05:16.280 --> 05:17.480
Rest assured.

05:17.680 --> 05:23.560
Ronin, why aren't you using the usual "yes"?

05:23.720 --> 05:28.030
Yeah, you said it would
be the fashionable line!

05:28.440 --> 05:29.640
Rest assured.

05:29.920 --> 05:33.990
You said you would be
happy the day you could...

05:34.160 --> 05:39.000
talk with only "yes".
Wasn't that your dream?

05:39.520 --> 05:40.720
Rest assured.

05:41.480 --> 05:42.680
Ronin.

05:43.440 --> 05:47.120
I wanted to use "assured" because
it sounds kinda like Aso, is that silly?

05:47.240 --> 05:48.590
It's not funny!

05:49.160 --> 05:52.600
- You should be ashamed of yourself.
- Rest assured...

05:57.080 --> 05:59.520
I know this place!

05:59.920 --> 06:02.590
Do you remember?

06:03.040 --> 06:08.560
It's where we landed after
leaving our hometown.

06:09.000 --> 06:15.870
Yes, it's the place the two of us mistook
for hell seeing all the lava and smoke.

06:16.520 --> 06:18.830
That's what we believed.

06:19.400 --> 06:21.710
Is the last artifact located here?

06:22.480 --> 06:25.840
What are Urashima's intentions?

06:32.240 --> 06:35.710
Lord Ieyasu, you are fantastic.

06:37.280 --> 06:40.030
Am I really fantastic?

06:40.560 --> 06:43.070
Lord Ieyasu, you are the best.

06:44.800 --> 06:47.000
Am I really the best?

06:48.200 --> 06:51.670
Huh? Don't scare me
like that, Dabi-Dabi!

06:53.240 --> 06:55.310
Looks like you're having fun.

06:55.480 --> 06:59.670
Do you also want to see my Fox Dance?

07:03.680 --> 07:04.950
You are the best.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.440
How young you are.

07:08.960 --> 07:11.400
But, what do you need from me?

07:11.600 --> 07:14.960
I forgot.
Urashima is here.

07:15.600 --> 07:18.830
The one who looks like Yasha but is not Yasha?

07:19.000 --> 07:20.270
The Yin-Yang monk?

07:20.440 --> 07:21.640
Yes.

07:21.800 --> 07:23.310
What does he want?

07:23.520 --> 07:27.750
He wants to teleport us somewhere.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.060
Where to?

07:29.080 --> 07:33.310
I don't know.
Someplace fun, I guess.

07:34.240 --> 07:37.390
I refuse! I don't know where
he wants us to go..

07:37.560 --> 07:42.830
but I'd rather have
fun here with Ranmaru.

07:43.440 --> 07:46.720
Lord Ieyasu, do me this favor.

07:48.400 --> 07:50.390
Right?

07:51.000 --> 07:53.750
All right. In that case, I'll go alone.

07:53.920 --> 07:55.880
Bring me back a souvenir.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.950
All right!

07:58.120 --> 08:01.310
- Lord Ieyasu, you are fantastic.
- That's right!

08:01.480 --> 08:03.790
What shall we play now?

08:05.360 --> 08:06.560
Here I am.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.110
What about Ryogen?

08:11.680 --> 08:13.270
He's not coming.

08:13.440 --> 08:14.760
What a pity.

08:15.040 --> 08:19.400
And you, Dabinoji,
I mean Leonardo Di Caprio.

08:19.920 --> 08:23.880
I'm "da Vinci", I never set
foot on the Titanic.

08:24.400 --> 08:25.600
Forgive me.

08:26.520 --> 08:29.030
I'm going for sure.

08:29.440 --> 08:35.430
I would go to the ends of the
Earth for a fun place I don't know.

08:36.000 --> 08:37.800
I expected that.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.800
So where are we going?

08:40.480 --> 08:43.760
To Osaka Castle, to the seat of the shogunate.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.750
To do what?

08:46.280 --> 08:50.670
Musashi will soon take possession
of the seventh artifact.

08:50.840 --> 08:52.040
Then...

08:54.960 --> 08:58.030
I can expect a great show.

08:58.800 --> 09:01.520
Should we leave Ryogen here?

09:01.920 --> 09:06.470
Who cares! Besides, I found
something for him to do.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.710
No need to worry.

09:12.920 --> 09:14.480
A lava castle...

09:15.080 --> 09:16.350
Lava Castle.

09:16.560 --> 09:19.440
That's where the last artifact is.

09:19.880 --> 09:23.430
But how do we get to it?

09:24.160 --> 09:26.800
We'll just have to try.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.200
Yes.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.670
Are you done with the "rest assured"?

09:30.680 --> 09:34.830
I'm the man who says "yes" the best.

09:36.640 --> 09:37.840
Rest assured.

09:38.360 --> 09:41.270
There you are at last, Musashi Miyamoto.

09:41.440 --> 09:44.030
You are late, very late.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.870
I was beginning to doubt you.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.920
Where are you now?

09:56.680 --> 09:57.880
What is that?

09:59.400 --> 10:01.760
Who are you?

10:04.320 --> 10:07.070
You have a good brush stroke!

10:07.240 --> 10:11.070
Maybe you should be a
painter instead of a general.

10:11.280 --> 10:13.030
Who are you?

10:14.480 --> 10:19.240
This man is the great genius
painter Leonardo da Vinci.

10:19.400 --> 10:24.480
So he is the one who painted Molimana,
the most beautiful woman in the world?

10:24.800 --> 10:27.470
It's Mona Lisa, not Molimana.

10:28.000 --> 10:31.440
I know, just kidding.

10:32.080 --> 10:37.910
Sorry, Ryogen already made
that joke and it's not funny.

10:38.840 --> 10:42.310
I'm busy. I'll excuse myself for a moment.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.960
Understood.

10:45.960 --> 10:48.790
Mr. da Vinci, what are you
doing at Osaka Castle?

10:49.400 --> 10:53.520
I think I know some strange
things are going to happen.

10:54.000 --> 10:56.470
My Lord.

10:57.760 --> 11:00.590
What was that noise, my Lord?

11:00.760 --> 11:01.960
Mitsunari!

11:02.000 --> 11:07.630
Who are you?
A Tokugawa assassin after my Lord?

11:09.400 --> 11:17.120
Are you, Mitsunari Ishida, who was beheaded
by Ieyasu Tokugawa in real history?

11:18.080 --> 11:19.880
Beheaded?
What do you mean?

11:20.360 --> 11:22.190
Nothing, I'm talking to myself.

11:22.360 --> 11:27.200
Mitsunari, put your sword away.
This man is my painting professor!

11:27.360 --> 11:28.560
Really?

11:28.880 --> 11:32.870
Mr. da Vinci, will you teach me painting?

11:33.240 --> 11:35.310
You have a talent.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.880
Very well, I'll teach you.

11:40.320 --> 11:43.760
That's it, Mitsunari.
You can leave!

11:45.480 --> 11:46.830
I almost forgot.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.620
What?

11:48.640 --> 11:52.320
Is the defense of this castle up to par?

11:53.200 --> 11:56.800
The defense? Are you
talking about the guards?

11:57.400 --> 12:00.360
I'm talking about everything needed to fight.

12:00.840 --> 12:03.280
This castle is the seat of the shogunate!

12:03.440 --> 12:05.950
It is the safest in the country!

12:06.240 --> 12:08.040
That's better, then.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.870
But what are you talking about?

12:10.320 --> 12:15.520
It's just that this castle is in
danger of turning into a battlefield.

12:15.720 --> 12:16.780
Battlefield?

12:16.800 --> 12:19.950
Is that true, Mr. da Vinci?

12:21.000 --> 12:23.720
In real history, there is the
summer battle of Osaka.

12:23.880 --> 12:25.710
But now it is autumn.

12:25.880 --> 12:29.350
The autumn battle of Osaka is about to begin!

12:29.520 --> 12:30.920
The autumn battle of Osaka?

12:31.320 --> 12:33.360
Will the Tokugawa attack?

12:33.960 --> 12:37.320
Ieyasu no longer has the will to fight.

12:37.640 --> 12:40.630
His son Hidetada, then?

12:40.800 --> 12:43.470
He will stay in Sumpu.

12:43.640 --> 12:49.670
Then who will attack the castle
to overthrow the shogunate?

12:49.840 --> 12:53.200
Please tell me, Mr. da Vinci!

12:53.360 --> 12:55.110
Shall I say it or not?

12:55.680 --> 12:57.990
Mr. da Vinci, please!

12:58.520 --> 13:00.430
Please!

13:01.800 --> 13:03.470
It will be...

13:07.440 --> 13:09.080
Let's go, whenever you're ready.

13:11.080 --> 13:13.800
No mistakes are allowed.
Are you ready?

13:14.280 --> 13:15.550
I am!

13:16.160 --> 13:18.750
Master Musashi, are you ready?

13:19.720 --> 13:21.230
Whenever you want!

13:32.680 --> 13:35.040
Musashi, get ready!

13:36.560 --> 13:38.360
Yume, go!

13:50.880 --> 13:52.550
Musashi, now!

13:57.080 --> 13:59.200
Good!
The idea worked!

13:59.400 --> 14:00.580
Yes!

14:00.600 --> 14:04.670
No, he's in danger of losing
speed and falling into the magma!

14:04.880 --> 14:08.270
Oh no, Musashi will end up charred!

14:11.920 --> 14:13.750
Oh no, it's dangerous!

14:14.440 --> 14:17.510
Musashi, keep shooting!

14:24.600 --> 14:26.350
I'll help you!

14:30.000 --> 14:32.800
Ouch! Wait!

14:40.240 --> 14:42.470
That's it!
He succeeded!

14:42.640 --> 14:43.840
Yes.

14:44.200 --> 14:46.400
Congratulations, Master Musashi.

14:46.560 --> 14:47.990
His butt must hurt.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.220
Yes.

14:49.240 --> 14:52.550
Musashi, retrieve the last artifact!

14:52.920 --> 14:56.710
I know!
They ask too much of me.

14:58.920 --> 15:01.510
Yukimura Sanada, are you here?
Yukimura!

15:02.040 --> 15:03.950
You called for me, Lord Mitsunari?

15:05.160 --> 15:09.950
Reinforce the castle's defense to
the highest level immediately.

15:10.160 --> 15:12.280
Are we expecting a battle?

15:12.440 --> 15:16.200
I doubt it, but it is possible.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.310
Is our enemy Tokugawa?

15:18.760 --> 15:20.910
Seems like it isn't.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.880
The ayakashi, then?

15:23.080 --> 15:24.280
Well...

15:24.520 --> 15:28.990
Who is it, Lord Mitsunari?
No matter who the enemy is,

15:29.160 --> 15:33.600
as long as we're here, Osaka
Castle will be well protected!

15:34.000 --> 15:35.830
I hope so.

15:36.640 --> 15:44.030
But who wishes to overthrow the
shogunate by attacking Osaka Castle?

15:44.600 --> 15:46.000
A castle robber.

15:46.880 --> 15:48.080
Not him...

15:48.360 --> 15:49.950
Yes, him.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.910
Musashi Miyamoto.

15:53.040 --> 15:55.600
Why would Musashi come here?

15:55.800 --> 15:57.000
I don't know.

15:57.720 --> 16:03.030
But Musashi must be accompanied
by the princesses Kaguya and Yume.

16:03.520 --> 16:09.840
In that case, one of our comrades who is loyal
to Sanada, Sasuke Sarutobi, must be with them!

16:10.400 --> 16:12.790
But what does that mean?

16:14.720 --> 16:18.870
Is this stranger telling the truth?

16:19.040 --> 16:22.800
Will the autumn battle of Osaka take place?

16:29.160 --> 16:32.680
Is the last artifact really here?

16:41.960 --> 16:43.790
Which direction to take?

16:46.210 --> 16:48.640
THE LAST
ARTIFACT
IS THIS
WAY

16:49.320 --> 16:51.390
"The last artifact is this way".

16:52.080 --> 16:54.120
Who wrote that?

16:54.280 --> 16:57.030
Falling into the trap is perhaps the solution.

16:57.200 --> 17:00.350
Besides, I got tired of searching alone!

17:01.640 --> 17:05.270
It's time to go straight
in the direction indicated!

17:13.720 --> 17:15.200
Yeah, like that.

17:15.600 --> 17:19.480
One must not hesitate
to give strokes with vigor.

17:19.760 --> 17:20.960
Like that?

17:21.120 --> 17:24.190
That's right.
You are really good.

17:24.760 --> 17:26.270
Mr. da Vinci?

17:26.920 --> 17:28.120
What is it?

17:28.200 --> 17:34.360
Is it true that the castle thief Musashi
Miyamoto will storm the castle?

17:35.840 --> 17:41.310
According to the calculations
of my genius brain, I think so.

17:41.520 --> 17:43.320
But why?

17:44.000 --> 17:46.720
There is a Yin-Yang
monk named Urashima.

17:46.880 --> 17:51.560
My guess comes from his actions.

17:52.040 --> 17:59.510
Urashima is the same monk who hid
seven artifacts throughout Japan.

17:59.680 --> 18:01.080
Why is Musashi coming here?

18:03.360 --> 18:07.960
You will have the pleasure of
finding out when the battle begins.

18:13.360 --> 18:17.430
Soon I will have the Seven artifacts.

18:17.800 --> 18:21.710
Then everything will be finished.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.400
THE LAST
ARTIFACT
IS THIS
WAY

18:28.320 --> 18:31.680
Is the last artifact inside?

18:41.120 --> 18:44.800
"I got the last artifact.
You're too late."

18:44.960 --> 18:47.080
"You're always too late, you idiot."

18:47.280 --> 18:49.030
"Kojiro Sasaki."

18:49.240 --> 18:51.280
Kojiro Sasaki.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.840
That rascal...

18:57.800 --> 18:59.000
Master Musashi!

18:59.360 --> 19:02.030
Have you found the last artifact?

19:02.200 --> 19:05.510
We can imprison the ayakashi forever.

19:07.480 --> 19:08.800
Musashi?

19:09.480 --> 19:11.470
That bastard beat me to it!

19:11.680 --> 19:14.880
That bastard?
What bastard?

19:15.040 --> 19:17.480
No, Musashi, not him...

19:17.680 --> 19:18.950
Yes!

19:19.160 --> 19:20.480
Him?

19:20.640 --> 19:24.760
But what does he want to do with an artifact?

19:24.960 --> 19:26.160
Beats me!

19:27.120 --> 19:31.800
Musashi, who is this
infamous person you speak of?

19:32.400 --> 19:34.790
I refuse to utter his name.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.910
<i>In that case, let me introduce myself.</i>

19:43.240 --> 19:46.230
I am Kojiro Sasaki, adept of gun-dou!

19:50.600 --> 19:53.320
Is that him, Kojiro Sasaki?

19:53.880 --> 19:56.840
He's the guy Musashi hates the most in the world.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.800
But this "guy".

20:00.000 --> 20:02.280
Yes, it's true...

20:02.600 --> 20:05.800
He's not a man, but a woman!

20:05.960 --> 20:09.790
Or someone who has the
same tendencies as me!

20:15.240 --> 20:22.510
Musashi's eternal and best opponent, Kojiro Sasaki, was in fact a woman?

20:22.920 --> 20:29.760
I see, that's why old Master Takuan
lost his gun-dou duel against her.

20:30.120 --> 20:34.000
That lecherous old man has a soft
spot for women, he treats them well.

20:35.040 --> 20:39.400
Listen.
She is not so easy to beat.

20:39.760 --> 20:48.270
It's true. She pretends to be a man but
uses her woman side to rob castles.

20:48.440 --> 20:50.080
She's a coward!

20:50.720 --> 20:52.440
So many compliments!

20:52.920 --> 20:56.440
So Kojiro Sasaki was a "drag king"...

20:57.040 --> 20:58.630
Are you surprised?

20:59.360 --> 21:00.380
Yes.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.600
Yes.

21:01.760 --> 21:02.820
Yes.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.040
Yes.

21:09.680 --> 21:12.790
In addition, she has a
nice pair... F cup or G cup?

21:13.080 --> 21:17.520
Musashi, here is the artifact you want.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.800
Bastard, it was you!

21:20.160 --> 21:22.440
Damn, don't resent me.

21:23.200 --> 21:27.670
- Accept my old proposal.
- No way!

21:28.160 --> 21:29.360
What?

21:29.640 --> 21:32.390
I already told you long ago.

21:32.560 --> 21:36.110
I'm not going to accept your proposal at all!

21:36.600 --> 21:39.110
Then you'll have to take it from me by force!

21:39.520 --> 21:41.080
Are you okay with that?

21:41.480 --> 21:43.040
Whenever you want!

21:43.520 --> 21:44.720
Master Ronin.

21:44.920 --> 21:48.200
What is this proposal Kojiro mentioned?

21:48.720 --> 21:52.270
It is so unbearable that
I cannot talk about it.

21:52.440 --> 21:56.510
Master Ronin, what could
this terrible proposal be?

22:07.000 --> 22:12.320
The boomerang effect!
The return was faster!

22:26.440 --> 22:29.990
This battle has been written for a long time.

22:30.320 --> 22:32.630
This fight is absurd.

22:32.800 --> 22:35.680
It is clear that you are going to lose.

22:36.160 --> 22:39.120
Do you really want to fight, Musashi?

22:39.280 --> 22:40.790
Of course!

22:41.320 --> 22:43.760
Well, I will face you.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.790
Who does she think she is?

22:46.640 --> 22:50.150
Look at that!
Did you find a new gun?

22:50.360 --> 22:53.510
Yes, it's the demon gun!

22:53.680 --> 22:57.040
It's a legendary gun, only two exist!

22:57.240 --> 22:58.990
The demon gun?

22:59.640 --> 23:01.710
Do you know about it?

23:01.920 --> 23:03.120
I do.

23:03.640 --> 23:07.870
True, she also trained
with Master Takuan.

23:08.040 --> 23:11.080
She has at least heard of it.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.440
Yes.

23:12.560 --> 23:14.280
But you know, Musashi.

23:14.440 --> 23:17.960
Gun-dou is not reliant on
which weapon you have.

23:18.360 --> 23:19.950
I know that!

23:20.440 --> 23:28.280
We will find out who is the best castle robber and the best gun-dou practitioner.

23:29.640 --> 23:31.200
I hope so!

25:31.400 --> 25:32.600
The last episode?

25:33.080 --> 25:34.910
Are you for real?

25:35.080 --> 25:38.950
And the last episode is titled "Love"?

25:39.640 --> 25:42.080
Is this series really going to end?
